### 1. Get all contracts
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts
Authorization: {{token}}

### 2. Get contracts with filters (OR logic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts?title=Service&is_active=true&limit=5
Authorization: {{token}}

### 3. Get contracts by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts?status=active
Authorization: {{token}}

### 4. Get expiring contracts
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts?status=expiring
Authorization: {{token}}

### 5. Get contracts by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts?date_signed_from=2024-01-01&expiry_date_to=2024-12-31
Authorization: {{token}}

### 6. Get contracts with unlimited results
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts?limit=*
Authorization: {{token}}

### 7. Create a new contract
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Software Development Contract",
  "contract_counter_party_id": 1,
  "business_unit_id": 1,
  "date_signed": "2024-08-01",
  "expiry_date": "2025-08-01",
  "is_active": true
}

### 8. Get specific contract
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 9. Update contract
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contracts/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Software Development Contract",
  "expiry_date": "2025-12-31"
}

### 10. Partial update contract
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/contracts/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 11. Delete contract
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contracts/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### 12. Test validation errors - missing required fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### 13. Test validation errors - invalid dates
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Contract",
  "contract_counter_party_id": 1,
  "business_unit_id": 1,
  "date_signed": "2024-08-01",
  "expiry_date": "2024-07-01"
}

### 14. Test authorization - without token
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts

### 15. Test with non-existent counter party
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Contract",
  "contract_counter_party_id": 999,
  "business_unit_id": 1,
  "date_signed": "2024-08-01",
  "expiry_date": "2025-08-01"
}
